i>\n<li><a href=\"Public-and-Government-Inquiries\">Public and Government Inquiries</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://gazette.govt.nz/\">New Zealand Gazette</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"home-section-nav last\"><a class=\"btn-big last\" href=\"About-Internal-Affairs\">About Internal Affairs</a>\n<ul class=\"green\">\n<li><a href=\"About-Internal-Affairs---Ministers-and-governance---Our-Ministers\">Our Ministers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"About-Internal-Affairs---Our-people\">Our people</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"About-Internal-Affairs---Our-People---Our-Purpose-and-Values\">Our purpose and principles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.dia.govt.nz/About-Internal-Affairs---Careers-with-us\">Careers with us</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Resource-material-Corporate-Publications-Annual-Reports\">Our 2023 Annual Report</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"About-Internal-Affairs---Department-structure---Business-units\">Our organisation and roles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Proactive-Releases\">Proactive releases</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info grey info-wide go-left\" style=\"height: 270px;\">\n<h3>Recent features</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/fire-and-emergency-funding\">Fire and Emergency funding &ndash; information gathering on alternatives</a> (18 June 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Regional-Deals\">City and Regional Deals</a><span> (updated 14 May 2026)</span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"Simplifying-Local-Government\">Simplifying Local Government</a><span> (Updated June 2026)</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"Online-Casino-Gambling\">Online Casino Gambling</a><span>&nbsp;(updated July 2026)</span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"Government-Inquiry-into-the-Fatal-Landslides-in-Tauranga\">Government Inquiry into the Fatal Landslides in Tauranga</a><span> (25 March 2026)</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Development-levies-consultation\">Going for Housing Growth - development levies</a>&nbsp;(Consultation closed 20 February 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/local-government-performance-metrics\">Council performance measurement</a>&nbsp;(published 31 July 2025)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/diawebsite.nsf/wpg_URL/About-us-Our-Organisation-Disclosure-of-chief-executive-expenses-gifts-and-hospitality\">Disclosure of chief executive expenses - 2024-25</a>&nbsp;(published 24 July 2025)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Resource-material-Our-Policy-Advice-Areas-Local-Government-Policy?OpenDocument#crown-observer\">Crown Observer appointed to Wellington City Council</a> (updated March 2025)</p>\n<p><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://survivorexperiences.govt.nz/\">Survivor Experiences Service</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info orange info-narrow go-right\" style=\"height: 270px;\">\n<h3>Latest news&nbsp;</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/f07609fb62889341cc258e310039e07a!OpenDocument\">Favourite M\u0101ori baby names in Aotearoa revealed</a> <br/>(9 July 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/39b081a3433da1d2cc258e20002f0c9e!OpenDocument\">Christchurch man sentenced for New Zealand&rsquo;s largest ever illegal lottery</a> (24 June 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/f56bdf4977cf7904cc258e1e0017235d!OpenDocument\">Sector risk assessment highlights money laundering risks facing real estate agents</a> (22 June 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/7d42034f591e35e6cc258e1a001326a9!OpenDocument\">High-value goods in spotlight as businesses urged to watch for money laundering risks</a> (18 June 2026)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/press.nsf/d77da9b523f12931cc256ac5000d19b6/d5a0e3a5ee07322fcc258e190019a633!OpenDocument\">Multiple formal warnings signal tougher stance on anti-money laundering non-compliance</a> (17 June 2026)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.dia.govt.nz/Media-contacts\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">More news releases</strong></a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"info red\">\n<h3><a name=\"Public-service-updates\"></a>Public service updates</h3>\n<p><em><strong>Aotearoa:</strong></em></p>\n<p>Our public counters are open for appointment only. To book an appointment, please visit our websites below. We encourage you to apply wherever possible using our online services:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.govt.nz/organisations/births-deaths-and-marriages\">Births, deaths and marriages</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.passports.govt.nz\">Passports</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.govt.nz/browse/passports-citizenship-and-identity/nz-citizenship/how-to-apply-for-nz-citizenship/apply-for-nz-citizenship\">Citizenship</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>National Library and Archives NZ:</strong></em></p>\n<p>Please follow guidelines for visiting&nbsp;<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://natlib.govt.nz/about-us/covid-19-coronavirus-update\">The National Library</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.archives.govt.nz/covid-19-coronavirus-update\">Archives NZ</a><span><br/></span></p>\n<p><em><strong>Sydney:</strong></em></p>\n<p>Our Bond Street office is open by appointment. Head to our website to <a class=\"external\" title=\"Make an appointment for Sydney office.\" href=\"https://bookings.gettimely.com/departmentofinternalaffairs1/bb/book\">book an appointment</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>London:</strong></em></p>\n<p>Our London office is open by appointment only &ndash; <a class=\"external\" href=\"https://www.passports.govt.nz/contactus/in-the-united-kingdom/\">please contact us</a> to make an appointment.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"info green\">\n<h3>Emergency information for DIA staff</h3>\n<p class=\"xmsonormal\"><strong>There are currently no emergencies or announcements.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n<div id=\"footer\">\n<div class=\"footer-top\">\n<div id=\"ft\">\n<div class=\"subnav\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/About-Internal-Affairs---Ministers-and-governance\">Our Ministers</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/About-Internal-Affairs---Our-people\">Our people</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/About-Internal-Affairs---Careers-with-us\">Careers with us</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Media-contacts\">Media contacts</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Logos\">Using our logos</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Legal-Privacy-Index\">Privacy</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Transparency\">Transparency</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Terms-of-use\">Terms of use</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Contact-us\">Contacts</a>|</li>\n<li><a href=\"/Official-Information-Act-requests\">OIA info</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"banner\">\n<div class=\"content\">\n<a href=\"/Our-websites\">See all DIA websites</a>\n<a href=\"/Our-social-media\">See all DIA social media sites</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\"><p>This site is managed by the <a href=\"/About-this-site\">Department of Internal Affairs</a><br/>\n<a href=\"/Legal-Copyright-Index\">Crown Copyright &copy; 2021</a></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.govt.nz/\" id=\"logo-nzgovt\">www.govt.nz</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script async type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/events.js\"></script>\n<noscript><p><img src=\"/no_script.gif\" style=\"border:0\" alt=\"\"/></p></noscript>\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
